      ⍝ STIR: advance the random link by an amount taken from the clock, so
      ⍝ a game deals differently on every run. The rolls it makes are thrown
      ⍝ away; only their effect on the link is wanted.
      ∇STIR;N
[1]   N←?(1+60|⌶20)⍴2
